   "raw": "Page 1\nRDB40_V.1.0\nCPU\nMediaTek MT7628\nRAM\n128 MB\nFLASH\n32 MB\nWAN\n1x 10/100 (Active POE)\nLAN\n1x 10/100\nWi-Fi\n802.11 b/g/n\nReset\nPinhole Reset Button\nAntenna\nWi-Fi: 2x Internal Antenna\nBLE: 1x Internal Antenna\nStatus LED\n2x Power,1x Wi-Fi 2.4G, 1x PRG/BLE, 2x Ethernet\nPower Connector\nDC Jack /PoE\nInput Voltage Range\n12 Vdc (DC Jack)\n44-57 Vdc (Active PoE IN (802.3 af))\nPower Adapter\nYES\nEnclosure Material\nABS Plastic\nColour\nWhite\nMounting\nCeiling Mount\nDesign\nFanless\nDimensions\n190mmx190mmx40mm (W x D x H)\nWeight\n290 gm\nWorking Environment\nIndoor\nRDB40\nDATA SHEET\nPRODUCT INFO\nPROCESSOR\nMediaTek MT7628,128 MB DDR RAM, 32 MB Flash\nWi-Fi\n2.4 Ghz Wi-Fi, AP/Station\nINTERFACE\n1x LAN 10/100, 1x WAN 10/100\nPOWER\n12V DC IN/ Active PoE IN (802.3 af)\nOPERATING SYSTEM\nOpen-WRT Linux\nHardware Specification\nBLE\nnRF54L05 BLE 6.0 SOC with LR Radio and 128 MHz Arm®\nCortex®-M33 processor, 500KB NVM and 96KB RAM\nPage 2\nRDB40_V.1.0\nSPATIAL MEASUREMENT:\nT\nBLE Chipset\nnRF54L05 BLE 6.0 SOC with LR Radio and 128 MHz Arm® Cortex®-M33\nprocessor, 500KB NVM and 96KB RAM\nRF Front End (FEM)\nIntegrated FEM with +20dB PA and 13 dB LNA Gain (nRF21540 -Range\nExtender)\nOperating Frequency\n2400 MHz to 2500 MHz\nChannel spacing\n1MHz\nOn the Air Data Rate\n125kbps-4000kbps\nTransmit power\n7dBm at BLE SOC , Additional 5dBm to 22dBm Gain setting in PA of the FEM\nReceive Sensitivity\n-104 dBm @125 kbps Bluetooth LE mode for BLE SOC, Additional 13dBm gain\nin LNA of FEM\n-96 dBm @1Mbps with 0.1% BER for BLE SOC, Additional 13dBm gain in LNA\nof FEM\nTechnology\n802.11 b/g/n\nChannel Selector\nAuto/Configurable\nChannel Width\n20 MHz, 20/40 MHz\nWi-Fi Mode\nAccess Point (AP), Station, AP & Client, Guest Wi-Fi\nTX Power\nConfigurable\nAuthentication\nWPA (PSK), WPA2 (PSK), WPA3 (PSK), WPA & WPA2 Mixed Mode, WPA2 &\nWPA3 Mixed Mode\nEncryption\nTKIP, AES, TKIP & AES\nWi-Fi Scheduler\nScheduled ON/OFF\nMAC ID Filtering\nWhitelisting, Blacklisting\nOther\nWMM (Enabled/Disabled)\nStorage Temperature\n-30 ~ 70 °C\nOperating Temperature\n0~ 50 °C\nHumidity\n10 ~ 90% (non-condensing)\nRDB40 Router with Plastic housing, *Power Adapter, 01-meter Ethernet cable.\nOperational & Environmental\nStandard Packaging\nBLUETOOTH SPECIFICATIONS\n40 mm\nPower LED\nProgramme LED\nDC Jack\nWAN/PoE\nLAN\nReset Button\nWi-Fi\nPage 3\nRDB40_V.1.0\n*All rights reserved, subject to change without prior notice.\nGet in touch:\nsales@invendis.com\nwww.silbonetworks.com\nInvendis Technologies India Private Limited\nNo. 230, 1st Cross, 38th Main, BOOHBCS Layout, BTM\n2nd Stage, Bangalore – 560 068\n190 mm\nPower LED\nWi-Fi LED\nBluetooth LED"
